        <briefdescription>
<para>Construct the suffix tree for the prefix of the input ending at <computeroutput>EndIdx</computeroutput>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Used to construct the full suffix tree iteratively. At the end of each step, the constructed suffix tree is either a valid suffix tree, or a suffix tree with implicit suffixes. At the end of the final step, the suffix tree is a valid tree.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>EndIdx</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The end index of the current prefix in the main string. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>SuffixesToAdd</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The number of suffixes that must be added to complete the suffix tree at the current phase.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>The number of suffixes that have not been added at the end of this step. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
